  "summary": "The Dataflow API now supports filtering job listings by creation and termination time ranges. This enhancement applies to both aggregated and location-specific job list methods, providing more granular control over job visibility.",
  "details": "Developers can now use `createTimeRange` and `terminationTimeRange` parameters when listing Dataflow jobs. These new optional parameters, each with `startTime` and `endTime` (formatted as `google-datetime` strings), are available on the `projects.jobs.aggregated`, `projects.jobs.list`, and `projects.locations.jobs.list` methods. This allows for more precise querying of jobs based on when they were created or completed.",
